          <msContents>
            <summary/>
            
           <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">
              <locus from="1r" to="76r"/>
             <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2715John">Gospel of John</title>
              <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
              <incipit xml:lang="gez" type="inscriptio">
                <locus target="#1v"/>
                ብስራተ፡ አብ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ረድእ፡ ትሩፍ፡ ተናጋሪ፡ በመለኮት፡ ፍቁረ፡ እግዚእነ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡
              </incipit>
             <note>The title on <locus target="#1v"/> is added in a secondary hand. The text starts in correspondence of John 1:29 
               (<supplied reason="lost">ለእግዚአብሔ</supplied>ር፡). 
               The text is incomplete due to the loss of two leaves; however, the missing text has been added on <locus from="1v" to="3v"/>.</note>
             <explicit type="expanded" xml:lang="gez">
               <locus target="#76r"/>
               መልአ፡ ጽሕፈተ፡ ብስራቱ፡ ለዮሐንስ፡ ወልደ፡ ወንጌላዊ፤ ሐዋርያ፡ ፩እም፲ወ፪ሐዋርያት፡ ዘጸሐፎ፡ በዮናኒ፡ ለሰብአ፡ ሀገረ፡ ኤፌሶን። እምድኅረ፡ ዕርገቱ፡ ለእግዚእነ፡ 
               ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ በሥጋ፡ ውስተ፡ ሰማይ። በ፴ወበ፰ዓመተ፡ መንግሥቱ፡ ለኔሮን፡ ቄሣር፡ ንጉሠ፡ ሮም። ወስብሐት፡ ለእግዚአብሔር፡ ለዓለመ፡ ዓለም፡ አሜን፡
             </explicit>
            </msItem>        
            
            <msItem xml:id="ms_i2">
              <locus from="76v" to="91r"/>
              <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1099Anapho">ʾAkkʷateta qʷǝrbān za-qǝddus Hǝryāqos za-hagara Bǝhnǝsā</title>
              <textLang mainLang="gez"/>
              <incipit type="inscriptio" xml:lang="gez">
                አኰቴተ፡ ቍርባን፡ ዘእግዝእትነ፡ ማርያም፡ ወላዲተ፡ አምላክ፡ ዘደረሰ፡ ላቲ፡ አባ፡ ሕትያቆድ፡ ኤጲስ፡ ቆጶስ፡ ዘሀገረ፡ ብሕንሳ፡
              </incipit>          
              <explicit xml:lang="gez">
                እግዝእትነ፡ ቅድስት፡ ወንጽሕት፡ ይእቲ፡ ወትረ፡ በሰማይ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ወበምድር፡ ጸሎታ፡ 
                <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/>
              </explicit>        
            </msItem>        
            
            <msItem xml:id="ms_i3">
              <locus target="#91r"/>
              <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/NAR0003tables">Table for measuring the time of day throughout the year using the length of shadows</title>
              <note>The table is untitled and is divided into seven columns. It begins from the months of Maskaram and Maggābit.</note>
            </msItem>        
            
